{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-channels","title":"Platform Channel 通信：Flutter 与原生平台互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/foundations/platform-channels","wordCount":923,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"platform-channel-通信-flutter-与原生平台互操作\">Platform Channel 通信：Flutter 与原生平台互操作</h1><p>Flutter 的自绘引擎使其在 UI 层完全独立于平台，但现实应用总需要调用平台原生能力：相机、蓝牙、生物识别、推送通知……Platform Channel 是 Flutter 与宿主平台（iOS/Android）通信的唯一正式机制。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>MethodChannel</strong></td>\n<td>请求/响应式 Channel，适合单次方法调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>EventChannel</strong></td>\n<td>单向事件流 Channel，原生持续向 Flutter 推送数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>BasicMessageChannel</strong></td>\n<td>双向消息 Channel，支持自定义序列化格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>BinaryMessenger</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter Engine 内部的消息路由器，所有 Channel 底层共用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>StandardMessageCodec</strong></td>\n<td>默认的消息序列化器，支持 Dart 基本类型与集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>PlatformException</strong></td>\n<td>原生侧抛出错误时，Flutter 侧收到的异常类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Pigeon</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter 官方代码生成工具，从 Dart 接口定义生成两端类型安全代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Background Isolate Channels</strong></td>\n<td>Flutter 3.7+ 允许在 Worker Isolate 中调用 Platform Channel</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"platform-channel-架构\">Platform Channel 架构</h2><p>Flutter 提供三种 Channel 类型，满足不同通信模式需求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Channel 类型</th>\n<th>通信方向</th>\n<th>编码方式</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>MethodChannel</strong></td>\n<td>双向（请求/响应）</td>\n<td>标准 MessageCodec</td>\n<td>单次调用：获取设备 ID、触发权限请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>EventChannel</strong></td>\n<td>原生 → Flutter（单向流）</td>\n<td>标准 MessageCodec</td>\n<td>持续事件：传感器、位置更新、网络状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>BasicMessageChannel</strong></td>\n<td>双向（无结构化）</td>\n<td>自定义 MessageCodec</td>\n<td>自定义序列化场景（如 protobuf）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph Flutter[&quot;Flutter(Dart)&quot;]&#10;    MC[MethodChannel\\n.invokeMethod]&#10;    EC[EventChannel\\n.receiveBroadcastStream]&#10;    BC[BasicMessageChannel\\n.send / .setMessageHandler]&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  subgraph Bridge[&quot;Flutter Engine\\n(C++ / Dart VM)&quot;]&#10;    BinaryMessenger&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  subgraph Native[&quot;原生平台(iOS / Android)&quot;]&#10;    NMC[FlutterMethodChannel\\nFlutterEventChannel]&#10;    iOS[Swift / ObjC]&#10;    Android[Kotlin / Java]&#10;  end&#10;&#10;  MC &lt;--&gt;|BinaryMessage| BinaryMessenger&#10;  EC --&gt;|Stream| BinaryMessenger&#10;  BC &lt;--&gt;|BinaryMessage| BinaryMessenger&#10;  BinaryMessenger &lt;--&gt;|Platform Thread| NMC&#10;  NMC --&gt; iOS&#10;  NMC --&gt; Android\">graph LR\n  subgraph Flutter[\"Flutter(Dart)\"]\n    MC[MethodChannel\\n.invokeMethod]\n    EC[EventChannel\\n.receiveBroadcastStream]\n    BC[BasicMessageChannel\\n.send / .setMessageHandler]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Bridge[\"Flutter Engine\\n(C++ / Dart VM)\"]\n    BinaryMessenger\n  end\n\n  subgraph Native[\"原生平台(iOS / Android)\"]\n    NMC[FlutterMethodChannel\\nFlutterEventChannel]\n    iOS[Swift / ObjC]\n    Android[Kotlin / Java]\n  end\n\n  MC &lt;--&gt;|BinaryMessage| BinaryMessenger\n  EC --&gt;|Stream| BinaryMessenger\n  BC &lt;--&gt;|BinaryMessage| BinaryMessenger\n  BinaryMessenger &lt;--&gt;|Platform Thread| NMC\n  NMC --&gt; iOS\n  NMC --&gt; Android</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"methodchannel-请求-响应模式\">MethodChannel：请求/响应模式</h2><p>MethodChannel 是最常用的 Channel 类型，适合「调用原生方法并等待结果」的场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"dart-侧实现\">Dart 侧实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"class DeviceInfoService {&#10;  static const _channel = MethodChannel(&#39;com.example.app/device_info&#39;);&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;String&gt; getDeviceId() async {&#10;    try {&#10;      final deviceId = await _channel.invokeMethod&lt;String&gt;(&#39;getDeviceId&#39;);&#10;      return deviceId ?? &#39;unknown&#39;;&#10;    } on PlatformException catch (e) {&#10;      // 原生侧抛出的异常&#10;      throw DeviceInfoException(&#39;Failed to get device ID: ${e.message}&#39;);&#10;    } on MissingPluginException {&#10;      // Channel 未注册（通常是测试环境）&#10;      return &#39;test-device-id&#39;;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  Future&lt;Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt;&gt; getSystemInfo() async {&#10;    final result = await _channel.invokeMapMethod&lt;String, dynamic&gt;(&#39;getSystemInfo&#39;);&#10;    return result ?? {};&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class DeviceInfoService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static const _channel = MethodChannel('com.example.app/device_info');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;String> getDeviceId() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    try {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final deviceId = await _channel.invokeMethod&#x3C;String>('getDeviceId');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return deviceId ?? 'unknown';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } on PlatformException catch (e) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 原生侧抛出的异常</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      throw DeviceInfoException('Failed to get device ID: ${e.message}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } on MissingPluginException {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // Channel 未注册（通常是测试环境）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return 'test-device-id';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Future&#x3C;Map&#x3C;String, dynamic>> getSystemInfo() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final result = await _channel.invokeMapMethod&#x3C;String, dynamic>('getSystemInfo');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return result ?? {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"android-侧-kotlin\">Android 侧（Kotlin）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class DeviceInfoPlugin : FlutterPlugin, MethodCallHandler {&#10;  private lateinit var channel: MethodChannel&#10;  private lateinit var context: Context&#10;&#10;  override fun onAttachedToEngine(binding: FlutterPlugin.FlutterPluginBinding) {&#10;    channel = MethodChannel(binding.binaryMessenger, &quot;com.example.app/device_info&quot;)&#10;    channel.setMethodCallHandler(this)&#10;    context = binding.applicationContext&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  override fun onMethodCall(call: MethodCall, result: Result) {&#10;    when (call.method) {&#10;      &quot;getDeviceId&quot; -&gt; {&#10;        val deviceId = Settings.Secure.getString(&#10;          context.contentResolver,&#10;          Settings.Secure.ANDROID_ID&#10;        )&#10;        result.success(deviceId)&#10;      }&#10;      &quot;getSystemInfo&quot; -&gt; {&#10;        result.success(mapOf(&#10;          &quot;os&quot; to &quot;Android&quot;,&#10;          &quot;version&quot; to Build.VERSION.RELEASE,&#10;          &quot;model&quot; to Build.MODEL&#10;        ))&#10;      }&#10;      else -&gt; result.notImplemented()&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  override fun onDetachedFromEngine(binding: FlutterPlugin.FlutterPluginBinding) {&#10;    channel.setMethodCallHandler(null)&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class DeviceInfoPlugin : FlutterPlugin, MethodCallHandler {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  private lateinit var channel: MethodChannel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  private lateinit var context: Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  override fun onAttachedToEngine(binding: FlutterPlugin.FlutterPluginBinding) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    channel = MethodChannel(binding.binaryMessenger, \"com.example.app/device_info\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    channel.setMethodCallHandler(this)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    context = binding.applicationContext</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  override fun onMethodCall(call: MethodCall, result: Result) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when (call.method) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \"getDeviceId\" -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val deviceId = Settings.Secure.getString(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          context.contentResolver,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          Settings.Secure.ANDROID_ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result.success(deviceId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      \"getSystemInfo\" -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result.success(mapOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          \"os\" to \"Android\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          \"version\" to Build.VERSION.RELEASE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          \"model\" to Build.MODEL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      else -> result.notImplemented()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  override fun onDetachedFromEngine(binding: FlutterPlugin.FlutterPluginBinding) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    channel.setMethodCallHandler(null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ios-侧-swift\">iOS 侧（Swift）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"public class DeviceInfoPlugin: NSObject, FlutterPlugin {&#10;  public static func register(with registrar: FlutterPluginRegistrar) {&#10;    let channel = FlutterMethodChannel(&#10;      name: &quot;com.example.app/device_info&quot;,&#10;      binaryMessenger: registrar.messenger()&#10;    )&#10;    let instance = DeviceInfoPlugin()&#10;    registrar.addMethodCallDelegate(instance, channel: channel)&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  public func handle(_ call: FlutterMethodCall, result: @escaping FlutterResult) {&#10;    switch call.method {&#10;    case &quot;getDeviceId&quot;:&#10;      result(UIDevice.current.identifierForVendor?.uuidString ?? &quot;unknown&quot;)&#10;    case &quot;getSystemInfo&quot;:&#10;      result([&#10;        &quot;os&quot;: &quot;iOS&quot;,&#10;        &quot;version&quot;: UIDevice.current.systemVersion,&#10;        &quot;model&quot;: UIDevice.current.model&#10;      ])&#10;    default:&#10;      result(FlutterMethodNotImplemented)&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeviceInfoPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">NSObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">FlutterPlugin </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> registrar: FlutterPluginRegistrar) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FlutterMethodChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"com.example.app/device_info\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      binaryMessenger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: registrar.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">messenger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DeviceInfoPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    registrar.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">addMethodCallDelegate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instance, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: channel)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call: FlutterMethodCall, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@escaping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FlutterResult) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> call.method {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"getDeviceId\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(UIDevice.current.identifierForVendor</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.uuidString </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"unknown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"getSystemInfo\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"os\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"iOS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UIDevice.current.systemVersion,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"model\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UIDevice.current.model</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    default:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(FlutterMethodNotImplemented)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"eventchannel-持续事件流\">EventChannel：持续事件流</h2><p>EventChannel 适合「订阅原生事件流」的场景，如传感器数据、位置更新。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"class AccelerometerService {&#10;  static const _channel = EventChannel(&#39;com.example.app/accelerometer&#39;);&#10;&#10;  Stream&lt;AccelerometerData&gt; get dataStream {&#10;    return _channel.receiveBroadcastStream().map((event) {&#10;      final map = Map&lt;String, double&gt;.from(event as Map);&#10;      return AccelerometerData(&#10;        x: map[&#39;x&#39;] ?? 0,&#10;        y: map[&#39;y&#39;] ?? 0,&#10;        z: map[&#39;z&#39;] ?? 0,&#10;      );&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class AccelerometerService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  static const _channel = EventChannel('com.example.app/accelerometer');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Stream&#x3C;AccelerometerData> get dataStream {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return _channel.receiveBroadcastStream().map((event) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      final map = Map&#x3C;String, double>.from(event as Map);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return AccelerometerData(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        x: map['x'] ?? 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        y: map['y'] ?? 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        z: map['z'] ?? 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Android Kotlin 侧：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class AccelerometerPlugin : FlutterPlugin, EventChannel.StreamHandler {&#10;  private lateinit var eventChannel: EventChannel&#10;  private var eventSink: EventChannel.EventSink? = null&#10;  private lateinit var sensorManager: SensorManager&#10;&#10;  override fun onListen(arguments: Any?, events: EventChannel.EventSink) {&#10;    eventSink = events&#10;    // 注册传感器监听&#10;    val sensor = sensorManager.getDefaultSensor(Sensor.TYPE_ACCELEROMETER)&#10;    sensorManager.registerListener(sensorListener, sensor,&#10;      SensorManager.SENSOR_DELAY_NORMAL)&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  override fun onCancel(arguments: Any?) {&#10;    sensorManager.unregisterListener(sensorListener)&#10;    eventSink = null&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private val sensorListener = object : SensorEventListener {&#10;    override fun onSensorChanged(event: SensorEvent) {&#10;      eventSink?.success(mapOf(&#10;        &quot;x&quot; to event.values[0],&#10;        &quot;y&quot; to event.values[1],&#10;        &quot;z&quot; to event.values[2]&#10;      ))&#10;    }&#10;    override fun onAccuracyChanged(sensor: Sensor, accuracy: Int) {}&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class AccelerometerPlugin : FlutterPlugin, EventChannel.StreamHandler {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  private lateinit var eventChannel: EventChannel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  private var eventSink: EventChannel.EventSink? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  private lateinit var sensorManager: SensorManager</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  override fun onListen(arguments: Any?, events: EventChannel.EventSink) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    eventSink = events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 注册传感器监听</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val sensor = sensorManager.getDefaultSensor(Sensor.TYPE_ACCELEROMETER)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sensorManager.registerListener(sensorListener, sensor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      SensorManager.SENSOR_DELAY_NORMAL)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  override fun onCancel(arguments: Any?) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sensorManager.unregisterListener(sensorListener)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    eventSink = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  private val sensorListener = object : SensorEventListener {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onSensorChanged(event: SensorEvent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      eventSink?.success(mapOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"x\" to event.values[0],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"y\" to event.values[1],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"z\" to event.values[2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun onAccuracyChanged(sensor: Sensor, accuracy: Int) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"pigeon-类型安全的代码生成方案\">Pigeon：类型安全的代码生成方案</h2><p>手写 Platform Channel 代码有两个痛点：<strong>类型不安全</strong>（原生侧和 Dart 侧的类型必须手动对齐）和<strong>样板代码繁琐</strong>。Pigeon 是 Flutter 官方提供的代码生成工具，从 Dart 接口定义自动生成两端的类型安全代码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"定义-api-dart\">定义 API（Dart）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// pigeons/device_info.dart&#10;import &#39;package:pigeon/pigeon.dart&#39;;&#10;&#10;@ConfigurePigeon(PigeonOptions(&#10;  dartOut: &#39;lib/src/generated/device_info.g.dart&#39;,&#10;  kotlinOut: &#39;android/src/main/kotlin/DeviceInfoApi.g.kt&#39;,&#10;  swiftOut: &#39;ios/Classes/DeviceInfoApi.g.swift&#39;,&#10;))&#10;class SystemInfo {&#10;  final String os;&#10;  final String version;&#10;  final String model;&#10;&#10;  SystemInfo({required this.os, required this.version, required this.model});&#10;}&#10;&#10;@HostApi()&#10;abstract class DeviceInfoHostApi {&#10;  String getDeviceId();&#10;  SystemInfo getSystemInfo();&#10;}&#10;&#10;@FlutterApi()&#10;abstract class DeviceInfoFlutterApi {&#10;  void onSystemUpdate(SystemInfo info);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// pigeons/device_info.dart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import 'package:pigeon/pigeon.dart';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@ConfigurePigeon(PigeonOptions(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  dartOut: 'lib/src/generated/device_info.g.dart',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  kotlinOut: 'android/src/main/kotlin/DeviceInfoApi.g.kt',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  swiftOut: 'ios/Classes/DeviceInfoApi.g.swift',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SystemInfo {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String os;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String version;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String model;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  SystemInfo({required this.os, required this.version, required this.model});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@HostApi()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract class DeviceInfoHostApi {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  String getDeviceId();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  SystemInfo getSystemInfo();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@FlutterApi()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract class DeviceInfoFlutterApi {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void onSystemUpdate(SystemInfo info);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>运行生成命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"dart run pigeon --input pigeons/device_info.dart\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pigeon</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --input</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pigeons/device_info.dart</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Pigeon 相比手写 Channel 的优势：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>手写 MethodChannel</th>\n<th>Pigeon</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>运行时检查，易出错</td>\n<td>编译时生成，类型安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样板代码</td>\n<td>两端手写，易不同步</td>\n<td>自动生成，永远同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档</td>\n<td>散落在代码注释</td>\n<td>集中在 Dart 接口定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护成本</td>\n<td>高（两端各改一次）</td>\n<td>低（改接口，重新生成）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"background-isolate-channels-flutter-3-7\">Background Isolate Channels（Flutter 3.7+）</h2><p>Flutter 3.7 之前，Platform Channel 只能在 main isolate 中调用。Flutter 3.7 引入了 <strong>Background Isolate Channels</strong>，允许在 Worker Isolate 中直接调用原生接口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// Flutter 3.7+：在 Isolate 中调用 Platform Channel&#10;Future&lt;void&gt; processInBackground() async {&#10;  final token = RootIsolateToken.instance!;&#10;&#10;  await Isolate.run(() async {&#10;    // 必须先注册 background isolate&#10;    BackgroundIsolateBinaryMessenger.ensureInitialized(token);&#10;&#10;    // 现在可以在 Isolate 中使用 MethodChannel&#10;    const channel = MethodChannel(&#39;com.example.app/heavy_processing&#39;);&#10;    final result = await channel.invokeMethod(&#39;processData&#39;, largeData);&#10;    return result;&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Flutter 3.7+：在 Isolate 中调用 Platform Channel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Future&#x3C;void> processInBackground() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final token = RootIsolateToken.instance!;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await Isolate.run(() async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 必须先注册 background isolate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    BackgroundIsolateBinaryMessenger.ensureInitialized(token);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 现在可以在 Isolate 中使用 MethodChannel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const channel = MethodChannel('com.example.app/heavy_processing');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final result = await channel.invokeMethod('processData', largeData);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"消息编码与性能\">消息编码与性能</h2><p>Platform Channel 通过 <code>BinaryMessenger</code> 传递字节数据，使用 <code>StandardMessageCodec</code> 序列化 Dart 对象：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Dart 类型</th>\n<th>序列化为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>null</code></td>\n<td>空字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n<td>1 字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>int</code></td>\n<td>4 或 8 字节（根据大小）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>double</code></td>\n<td>8 字节 IEEE 754</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>String</code></td>\n<td>UTF-8 编码 + 长度前缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Uint8List</code></td>\n<td>原始字节（最高效）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>List</code></td>\n<td>递归编码每个元素</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Map</code></td>\n<td>递归编码键值对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>性能提示</strong>：传递大量二进制数据时，使用 <code>Uint8List</code> 而非 <code>List&lt;int&gt;</code>，可避免逐元素装箱，性能提升数倍。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Platform Channel 是 Flutter 与原生平台的唯一通信桥梁。<strong>MethodChannel</strong> 适合单次调用，<strong>EventChannel</strong> 适合持续事件流，<strong>Pigeon</strong> 通过代码生成消除两端类型不匹配的风险。实际开发中优先使用社区成熟插件（pub.dev）；需要自定义时，优先选 Pigeon 而非手写 Channel，以减少维护成本。Flutter 3.7+ 的 Background Isolate Channels 进一步允许在 Worker Isolate 中直接调用原生接口，打通了并发计算与平台能力的最后一道墙。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"dart-runtime-concurrency\">Dart 运行时与并发模型</a> — Background Isolate Channels 的并发基础</li>\n<li><a href=\"../advanced/platform-views-embedding\">Platform Views 嵌入</a> — 更深入的原生视图集成</li>\n<li><a href=\"../advanced/isolates-ffi\">Isolates 与 FFI</a> — dart:ffi 作为 Platform Channel 的替代方案</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Platform Channel 通信：Flutter 与原生平台互操作","id":"platform-channel-通信-flutter-与原生平台互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Platform Channel 架构","id":"platform-channel-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"MethodChannel：请求/响应模式","id":"methodchannel-请求-响应模式"},{"level":3,"text":"Dart 侧实现","id":"dart-侧实现"},{"level":3,"text":"Android 侧（Kotlin）","id":"android-侧-kotlin"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS 侧（Swift）","id":"ios-侧-swift"},{"level":2,"text":"EventChannel：持续事件流","id":"eventchannel-持续事件流"},{"level":2,"text":"Pigeon：类型安全的代码生成方案","id":"pigeon-类型安全的代码生成方案"},{"level":3,"text":"定义 API（Dart）","id":"定义-api-dart"},{"level":2,"text":"Background Isolate Channels（Flutter 3.7+）","id":"background-isolate-channels-flutter-3-7"},{"level":2,"text":"消息编码与性能","id":"消息编码与性能"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"Dart 运行时与并发模型：Event Loop、Future、Isolate","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/foundations/dart-runtime-concurrency"},"next":{"title":"状态管理模式对比：Riverpod、Bloc、Provider 与 Signals","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/flutter-development/architecture/state-management-patterns"}}